perasaan Anda, Bu?

00:53:56.466 --> 00:53:57.901
Kayak lubang pantat.

00:53:58.068 --> 00:53:59.069
Wah, luar biasa.

00:54:05.175 --> 00:54:06.509
Lubang istri yang cantik.

00:54:08.812 --> 00:54:22.826
Ah, luar biasa.
Mau dijilat, Pak?

00:54:22.959 --> 00:54:23.960
