01:10:32.795 --> 01:10:35.030
Kamera ini merekam
ekspresi istrimu.

01:10:40.069 --> 01:10:41.070
Wah, hebat, digulung.

01:10:43.472 --> 01:10:44.773
Boleh, masuklah.

01:11:16.739 --> 01:11:17.740
Membulatkan milik istrimu.

01:11:21.310 --> 01:11:40.296
Nikmati saat keluar masuknya.
