Ah, tunggu sebentar ya.

01:17:35.584 --> 01:17:36.952
Ah, enak banget.

01:17:46.428 --> 01:17:48.664
Wah, hebat, hebat sekali Anda.

01:17:54.970 --> 01:17:56.138
Aduh, sakit.

01:17:56.271 --> 01:17:57.272
Sakit banget ya.

